{"id":"b575e2b9b2de46cc","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-saturation.md","title":"Ideal Saturation Theorem","display":"thm-saturation — Ideal Saturation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-saturation","aliases":["58-thm-saturation"],"display":"thm-saturation — Ideal Saturation Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-saturation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-saturation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-saturation — Ideal Saturation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6dd42dd522c20a30\" href=\"?note=6dd42dd522c20a30\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md\">../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (ideal candidate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (uncountable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal-indexed saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6dd42dd522c20a30\" href=\"?note=6dd42dd522c20a30\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md\">../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\)</span> (successor-cardinal relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Saturated}\">\\(\\mathrm{Saturated}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>-saturation alias characterized below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Saturated}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Saturated}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “saturated” means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>-saturated: the quotient Boolean algebra has the successor-cardinal chain condition. The successor is supplied by the registered relation rather than an unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> operator.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, there is no family of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> many <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-positive subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> whose pairwise intersections lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6dd42dd522c20a30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2079cb7dec7ca43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (uncountable cardinal, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6dd42dd522c20a30","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S$ (cardinal-indexed saturation predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2079cb7dec7ca43","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)$ (successor-cardinal relation, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Saturated}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}saturation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Saturated}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\exists\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1504,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-saturation.md|58-thm-saturation]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["6dd42dd522c20a30","5fb1c2241d1943d1","b2079cb7dec7ca43"]}